k information. After consultation, this information may be shared with other Trekkers. Do you consent to this?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_147","a","009","flurry",null,null,null,null,"huanxin","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_147","Yes, yes, I agree to everything. I think everyone needs to know about this...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_147","a","015","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_147","What I'm about to say might be hard to believe, but it all happened to me. I'll start from the beginning—",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","009","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["say","0","Half an hour later.",8,""],["show","avg3_102","a","021",null,-0.07,1.1,0,null,0.0],["show","avg1_147","a","002",null,-0.07,1.1,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,-100.0,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg3_102","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a","023",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_102","Hallucinations inside the Monolith... Behavioral control... This really is the first case of its kind. I'm very glad you're safe, Miss Caramel.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_102","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_147","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_147","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"daintou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_147","Yeah, I'm really glad to be alive...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_102","a",null,null,0.73,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_147","a","002",null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.7],["ctl","avg3_102","a","002",null,0.7,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["w",1],["say","avg3_102","Thank you for providing such valuable information. Miss Caramel, do you have time after this?",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_147","a","005",null,null,null,null,1.0,null,